      not list TrueFalse inputs, so anything sweepable has to be a number. }
    ReEntry_On             ( 0    ),  { 0 = off (ANCHOR setting). 1 = on. }
    ReEntry_Cooldown_On    ( 0    ),  { 0 = re-entry ignores Cooldown_Bars.
